From 531bdcf49772cd07bfc7231eeff84260d32fe3c6 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: x <x@x>
Date: Fri, 23 Oct 2026 18:55:10 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] sapphire-0166: boot the audio DSP (ADSP) and ask AudioReach
 whether it is up

Boot-arg audio=1: the LPASS Q6 is booted through TrustZone PAS (id 1)
from image/adsp.* in modem_a, the way the modem is, then watched over
its own SMP2P (items 429/443, APCS bit 10) and its own GLINK edge (SMEM
host 2, APCS bit 8) with two channels: IPCRTR (QRTR; our pd-mapper now
also maps the ADSP's root, sensor and audio domains, instance 74) and
adsp_apps (GPR). APM is asked APM_CMD_GET_SPF_STATE every 500 ms until
the signal processing framework answers ready. qrtr_send() routes a
packet for the ADSP's node to its edge.
